            "TOCHeading": "Fire Fighting",
            "Description": "This section provides fire fighting information, including fire fighting procedures and hazards.",
            "Information": [
              {
                "ReferenceNumber": 40,
                "Name": "",
                "Value": {
                  "StringWithMarkup": [
                    {
                      "String": "Use water spray, powder, foam, carbon dioxide. In case of fire: keep drums, etc., cool by spraying with water.",
